{"kind":"assert","text":"Lanes while the machine is on battery. At 18:29 EST it draws battery\npower with Low Power Mode on, so no gate starts (f27885cc). Four heads\nwait for a gate: CF-1, IE-1 with FG-1, C1 and PG-1. Work that needs no\ngate goes on now, each in its own lane:\n\n1. The C2 act before code (b1b1d492, 556eca2b): the list of readers\n   of `Own`, of `context.retained` and of `fixedHash`, the ports of\n   `RetainedOwn`, and each catch site. It is reading only.\n2. The CDF-1 act before code (1064d0de): stored total or scan, the\n   first turn of an old scope, and a scope already past the cap.\n3. NF-5 (c288c917) in source, on the C1 head 4fac2063. C1 gave\n   `byTarget` and the change signal to `memoryStore`, and NF-5 gives\n   them to the browser store.\n4. H1 (71bb8559) in source.\n\nA focused test run on battery is a working run. A timeout there is no\nevidence, so repeat the case on AC before you act on it. When AC\nreturns and powermode reads 0, CF-1 attempt 3 starts first.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}